      "supporting_excerpt": "RE: Ruling request concerning the tariff classification of an LCD module for motor vehicle applications; Decoder IC... The subject module is intended for automotive use as a driver or passenger display screen. At importation, software on the subject PCB subassembly is described as capable of a",
      "relevance_explanation": "This passage identifies the specific product type (LCD module for motor vehicle) and the company (Tianma America) relevant to the query, establishing the context for an automotive display ruling request.",
