    {
      "passage_id": "passage_6758c7d658b6ac0d291a27f0",
      "supporting_excerpt": "In ruling HQ H332752, CBP concluded that the country of origin of the devices is Taiwan because the assembly of the main PCBA in Taiwan results in a substantial transformation. Of particular importance, CBP stated, is that the PCBA enables the devices to distribute power to the LED lamps and therefore imparts the character of the devices.",
