    },
    {
      "passage_id": "passage_f445e06b808ab70d299ffc6e",
      "supporting_excerpt": "In the present matter, and in accordance with HQ H304910 and H218360, the assembly of the main PCBA in Taiwan results in a substantial transformation. We find that the SMT and curing processes incorporate a large number of discrete component parts onto a PCB, which is a sufficiently complex and meaningful operation so as to result in a substantial transformation of the parts making up the PCBA.",
      "relevance_explanation": "This passage details the specific operations (SMT, curing) that constitute substantial transformation for electronic assemblies, supporting the analysis of whether automotive display assembly qualifies.",
