    {
      "passage_id": "passage_47deed61a4957f053fa20c87",
      "supporting_excerpt": "Does simple assembly in another country change the country of origin? Generally no. Per CBP rulings including N357277 on control arms, simple assembly operations do not result in substantial transformation. The character remains the country of origin of the inputs that gave the product its essential identity.",
